{{#> layout
  title='VocabOwl Quiz'
  url='/vocabowl.html'
  metaDescription="Move beyond passive learning. Discover VocabOwl and use Vocably's smart dictionary and learning system to master real-world vocabulary through active translation."
  noCta=true
}}
  <style>
    .vo-hero {
      padding-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .vo-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
    }

    .vo-lead {
      max-width: 36rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .vo-wrap {
      max-width: 56rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .vo-status {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 94, 94, 0.25);
      background: rgba(255, 94, 94, 0.06);
      font-size: 1rem;

      & > i {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        color: var(--v-color-danger-active);
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      & p {
        margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      }
    }

    .vo-status-date {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--v-color-danger-active);
    }

    .vo-section {
      margin-bottom: 5rem;
    }

    .vo-section-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.2vw, 2rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .vo-story {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      line-height: 1.6;

      @media (width >= 768px) {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 19rem;
        gap: 4rem;
      }

      & p {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
    }

    .vo-shot {
      margin: 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;

      & img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 19rem;
        height: auto;
        padding: 1rem;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 1.5rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
        box-shadow: 0 1rem 2.5rem rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.12);
      }
    }

    .vo-try {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      background: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.04);
      text-align: center;

      @media (width >= 768px) {
        padding: 3.5rem 4rem;
      }

      & > p {
        max-width: 34rem;
        margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
      }
    }

    .vo-text {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .vo-try-form {
      max-width: 36rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .vo-cta {
      max-width: 36rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;

      & > p {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="vo-hero container-md text-center">
    <h1 class="vo-title">The VocabOwl Test.</h1>
    <p class="vo-lead">
      Find out exactly how many words you know — try the <a href="https://vocabowl-870366514258.us-west1.run.app/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">VocabOwl Quiz here<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right ms-2"></i></a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="container-md mb-5">
    <div class="vo-wrap">
      <div class="vo-status" role="status">
        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <div>
          <span class="vo-status-date">3 July, 2026</span>
          <p>The VocabOwl Test is currently unavailable. It seems like its creator has deleted the website.</p>
          <p>I will update this page if the VocabOwl site is back.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="vo-section">
        <div class="vo-story">
          <div>
            <h2 class="vo-section-title">Finished the test? Come back here to grow your vocabulary naturally, without disrupting your day.</h2>
            <p>
              Chances are, you've already spotted these essential VocabOwl words in your daily English interactions.
            </p>
            <p>
              You might have encountered these words before and found them intriguing. The trouble is, without a clear anchor, they rarely stick around for long.
            </p>
          </div>
          <figure class="vo-shot">
            <img
              width="416"
              height="674"
              alt="The screenshot of VocabOwl with the word Facetious answered incorrectly."
              src="/assets/facetious.png"
            />
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="vo-section vo-text">
        <p>
          The next time an interesting new word catches your eye, use Vocably to lock it into your memory. Vocably is a combination of a dictionary and a learning system available in your browser (<a href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/vocably/baocigmmhhdemijfjnjdidbkfgpgogmb" class="link-secondary" target="_blank">Chrome</a>, <a href="https://microsoftedge.microsoft.com/addons/detail/dahphaiflimmafjchchidjmgidlkajho" class="link-secondary" target="_blank">Edge</a>, <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6464076425" class="link-secondary" target="_blank">Safari</a>, <a href="/ios-safari-extension.html" class="link-secondary" target="_blank">iOS Safari</a>) and on mobile (<a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/vocably-pro-language-cards/id1641258757" class="link-secondary" target="_blank">iOS</a>, <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vocablypro" class="link-secondary" target="_blank">Android</a>).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="vo-section vo-try">
        <p>Feel free to try the Vocably dictionary online:</p>
        <div class="vo-try-form">
          {{> search-form-light
            sourceLanguage='en'
            query='facetious'
          }}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="vo-cta">
        <p>
          Vocably does more than look up words — it helps you keep them. Instantly save new discoveries to your personal cloud collection, study them seamlessly across all your devices, and transform unfamiliar words into a natural part of your everyday vocabulary.
        </p>
        {{> cta }}
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
{{/layout}}
